//　正式な能、つまり初番目から五番目までのすべての
//曲種を上演する<RUBY text='ごばんだて'>五番立</RUBY>の場合、一日掛かりの会になる。
//　やる方もだが観る方も<RUBY text='おおごと'>大事</RUBY>だ。

//　政務にも差し支えようし、流石にそれはあるまいが
//……。
  A traditional Noh program―that is, one which includes a play from each of the five categories―is a highly substantial affair. It generally runs from morning to night, and tests the stamina of the audience as well as of the actors.

  But as that would mean shutting down the castle for a day, it is unlikely to be what we're in store for here.

